{"4956910":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"While Shifu's Away: Senior Sister, I've Fallen for You!","steam_appid":4956910,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4956910\/extras\/25c6681830e4738c7267ca982c13177c.avif?t=1793722669\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4956910\/extras_big\/25c6681830e4738c7267ca982c13177c.avif?t=1793722669 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span>Senior Sister, I've Fallen for You! is a sweet romance visual novel set in a secluded mountain cottage. You mainly play as senior sister Xiaoqian, reading story scenes, choosing replies, and arranging daily actions while sensing junior brother Xiaoyuer's increasingly obvious feelings. Some scenes also shift into his point of view, revealing the sincerity behind his nervousness, awkward pauses, and attempts to stay composed. As the story unfolds, the junior brother, senior sister, and Shifu each perform their own theme song, letting you hear the thoughts and feelings they keep in their hearts.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4956910\/extras\/79d0101793747f9480593a79dcc05ff7.avif?t=1793722669\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4956910\/extras_big\/79d0101793747f9480593a79dcc05ff7.avif?t=1793722669 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4956910\/extras\/e280b0f05334aebe025704d8e510eee0.avif?t=1793722669\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4956910\/extras_big\/e280b0f05334aebe025704d8e510eee0.avif?t=1793722669 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><strong>A Quiet Romance in the Mountains<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shifu has left the mountain for a while, but life in the cottage continues. Cooking, washing clothes, chopping firewood, cultivating, gathering herbs, and drawing water remain part of each day. Without the usual watchful eyes that seem to understand everything, the feelings hidden in the senior sister and junior brother's words and gestures become harder to ignore.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can answer gently, tease him lightly, hold back, or be more direct. Each response can change the atmosphere of the moment and influence how the relationship and later events develop.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4956910\/extras\/a627e5d10681552df59a7fbea861ee11.avif?t=1793722669\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4956910\/extras_big\/a627e5d10681552df59a7fbea861ee11.avif?t=1793722669 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Three Characters, One Quiet Understanding<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The romance grows between the senior sister and junior brother, but their mountain life is also shaped by Shifu's knowing presence. Although he appears to be away, he seems to understand the subtle feelings between his two disciples. Sometimes he leaves them space; sometimes he gives the gentlest push, adding warmth and humor to their daily life.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Read, Choose, and Spend Each Day<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Experience a visual novel story told mainly from the senior sister's perspective.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Choose gentle, teasing, restrained, or direct replies.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Arrange daily actions such as cooking, washing clothes, chopping firewood, cultivating, gathering herbs, and drawing water.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Discover small objects hidden in selected scenes through light hotspot-search interactions.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Follow changes in date, time of day, weather, relationship signals, and other states.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- See choices, actions, and timing influence later scenes, relationship developments, and story routes.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4956910\/extras\/996fe3e3011295d1a36850f80c518645.avif?t=1793722669\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4956910\/extras_big\/996fe3e3011295d1a36850f80c518645.avif?t=1793722669 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Original Songs and Performance MVs<\/strong><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4956910\/extras\/07694261bac4c0c70b26f7b5b95cf281.avif?t=1793722669\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4956910\/extras_big\/07694261bac4c0c70b26f7b5b95cf281.avif?t=1793722669 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes original music, original character songs, and performance MVs. The junior brother, senior sister, and Shifu each have songs that appear at fitting story moments, expressing feelings the characters have not fully spoken aloud.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4956910\/extras\/25c6681830e4738c7267ca982c13177c.avif?t=1793722669\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4956910\/extras_big\/25c6681830e4738c7267ca982c13177c.avif?t=1793722669 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span>Senior Sister, I've Fallen for You! is a sweet romance visual novel set in a secluded mountain cottage. You mainly play as senior sister Xiaoqian, reading story scenes, choosing replies, and arranging daily actions while sensing junior brother Xiaoyuer's increasingly obvious feelings. Some scenes also shift into his point of view, revealing the sincerity behind his nervousness, awkward pauses, and attempts to stay composed. As the story unfolds, the junior brother, senior sister, and Shifu each perform their own theme song, letting you hear the thoughts and feelings they keep in their hearts.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4956910\/extras\/79d0101793747f9480593a79dcc05ff7.avif?t=1793722669\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4956910\/extras_big\/79d0101793747f9480593a79dcc05ff7.avif?t=1793722669 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4956910\/extras\/e280b0f05334aebe025704d8e510eee0.avif?t=1793722669\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4956910\/extras_big\/e280b0f05334aebe025704d8e510eee0.avif?t=1793722669 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><strong>A Quiet Romance in the Mountains<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shifu has left the mountain for a while, but life in the cottage continues. Cooking, washing clothes, chopping firewood, cultivating, gathering herbs, and drawing water remain part of each day. Without the usual watchful eyes that seem to understand everything, the feelings hidden in the senior sister and junior brother's words and gestures become harder to ignore.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can answer gently, tease him lightly, hold back, or be more direct. Each response can change the atmosphere of the moment and influence how the relationship and later events develop.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4956910\/extras\/a627e5d10681552df59a7fbea861ee11.avif?t=1793722669\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4956910\/extras_big\/a627e5d10681552df59a7fbea861ee11.avif?t=1793722669 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Three Characters, One Quiet Understanding<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The romance grows between the senior sister and junior brother, but their mountain life is also shaped by Shifu's knowing presence. Although he appears to be away, he seems to understand the subtle feelings between his two disciples. Sometimes he leaves them space; sometimes he gives the gentlest push, adding warmth and humor to their daily life.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Read, Choose, and Spend Each Day<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Experience a visual novel story told mainly from the senior sister's perspective.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Choose gentle, teasing, restrained, or direct replies.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Arrange daily actions such as cooking, washing clothes, chopping firewood, cultivating, gathering herbs, and drawing water.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Discover small objects hidden in selected scenes through light hotspot-search interactions.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Follow changes in date, time of day, weather, relationship signals, and other states.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- See choices, actions, and timing influence later scenes, relationship developments, and story routes.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4956910\/extras\/996fe3e3011295d1a36850f80c518645.avif?t=1793722669\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4956910\/extras_big\/996fe3e3011295d1a36850f80c518645.avif?t=1793722669 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Original Songs and Performance MVs<\/strong><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4956910\/extras\/07694261bac4c0c70b26f7b5b95cf281.avif?t=1793722669\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4956910\/extras_big\/07694261bac4c0c70b26f7b5b95cf281.avif?t=1793722669 width=1560 height=878 \/><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes original music, original character songs, and performance MVs. The junior brother, senior sister, and Shifu each have songs that appear at fitting story moments, expressing feelings the characters have not fully spoken aloud.<\/p>","short_description":"Shifu is away, and your shy junior brother can no longer hide his feelings. Play as the senior sister in a sweet xianxia romance visual novel where replies and daily choices shape your bond and lead to different endings. And yes, the main characters sing original songs!","supported_languages":"English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4956910\/ac0403ca51e7ce174c8ec7b15f9a5daa7509426d\/header.jpg?t=1793722669","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4956910\/20ef1b7db95f9eb83478459928fa68dc67e8bc3f\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793722669","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4956910\/20ef1b7db95f9eb83478459928fa68dc67e8bc3f\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793722669","website":"https:\/\/stream.gdan.com.tw\/vn01\/index.html","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-Bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core 2<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GT 930<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 4 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"legal_notice":"Copyright © 2026 GDAN SOFT CO., LTD. All rights reserved.","developers":["GDAN SOFT CO., LTD."],"publishers":["GDAN SOFT CO., LTD."],"price_overview":{"currency":"EUR","initial":379,"final":379,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"3,79€"},"packages":[1720206],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy While Shifu's Away: Senior Sister, I've Fallen for You!","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1720206,"percent_savings_text":" ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"While Shifu's Away: Senior Sister, I've Fallen for You! - 3,79€","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":379}]}],"pl